ces}} = \\frac{21.5}{3} \\approx 7.17\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{7.17}\n$$\n\nSo, Johnny's dad lost an **average of $7.17 per race** that day.", "decode_seconds": 3.247445440851152, "draft_calls": 90, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 103, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "d1f7ef8ff1f31ac794bb462df4653f71df803c9d4d99cc25c263394e8288eed5", "method": "relay_base", "output_hash": "585fea01c70e97d7b35c7012c2d7c5e3e23d453aaf1092aa1b3cfacc90cfb45a", "output_tokens": 436, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 18514356224, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 18719178752, "problem_id": "gsm8k/b7f59158b17ad0c2", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 480.5627202987671, "prefill_full_target": 32.75263977050781, "prefill_relay": 0.10623999685049057, "relay": 19.075968146324158, "unattributed_runtime": 38.04004856571555, "verification_full_target": 2711.729574203491}, "proposal_lengths": [15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "3", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 3.2822671909816563, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 18719178752, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 18658361344, "target_calls": 90, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.0329018821939826, "turn_index": 0}
